abstract: >-
  A reproducible positive-obstruction locality lemma for free124-edge fourteen-vertex
  3-graphs, relative to Markstrom-Talbot's published75-class count, and its minimum-six-repair
  corollary supplement the retained spectral exclusions and singleton classifications.
  Two distinct standard-library verifiers and all75 literal graphs are included.
  The Boolean application has additional unbundled premises; the original question
  remains open. Substantial AI assistance; novelty, formal verification and human
  peer review are not established.
